      "content": "Please do not give your 14-month-old apple juice or Gatorade right now, as these can worsen diarrhea and are not the best way to restore energy. The reduced wet diapers, combined with the diarrhea, are concerning signs that need immediate attention. Since your pediatrician is unavailable, you should call an urgent care center or use a telehealth service for guidance; this is not something to manage at home.",
